{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "ad563a2b1ee12b5e409915e8b745a57d4500da39feb17b2ecd3c797cf9d03a98", "ja": "もう、わかったよ。あずさお姉ちゃんは何が何でも、\n真美の前に立ちはだかる気だねっ！？", "zh": "真是的，明白了。梓姐姐无论如何都打算挡在真美面前，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "11c01b25e1a706a9516fd9360876dc22cfce116d3ed56b50d8837c2b29c58c39", "ja": "そ、そんな……\n立ちはだかってるつもりはないのよ、真美ちゃん？", "zh": "没、没这回事……\n我没打算挡在你面前呀，真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "e5c6825024dba48bf5fdbb37c65928d95905efae1d45837203a20fb6fa16e4fe", "ja": "でもでも～、真美の路線とダダ被りっしょ！？\nこのせくしーカワイイ路線と！", "zh": "可是可是～，这不是和真美的路线撞得一模一样嘛！？和这种性感可爱路线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "f042cc85bfc96ca2d3d755343e3d9029358c34b6a13ed878ffd6fbd00e773621", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　特にかぶってないような……？\nあ、将来的にはわかんないか、うん！", "zh": "是、是这样吗？感觉没怎么撞路线吧……？\n啊，今后就不好说了，嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "190e760258d310776a10e301aef04191e8585a72867637e8c734fb6733b0562d", "ja": "セクシーカワイイ路線……\n私って、そうなのかしら？", "zh": "性感可爱的路线……\n我……是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b878609c9197c4c897542131c98a40d9a7b47340eeafc0533a3e26197874d0f8", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　……あずささん、\nそこにいてくれましたか。ちょうどよかった。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！……梓小姐，\n原来你在这里啊。正好找你有事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "b4b72806cb4fffa249e13c085737acbe50868e85cdc3aa824eb1d3fff5051dc7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nおはようございます♪　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n早上好♪ 怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1007_p", "source_sha256": "14fc418d78c1ccfc2ffc0ca6aa14726d6237e38eac54780cf357728143b9c0c1", "ja": "あずささんに、新しい仕事をお願いしたくて。\nそれで……いや、まずは聴いてもらおうかな。", "zh": "我想请梓小姐接一份新工作。所以……不，还是先让你听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9293b2730983fbb215529cf4be482318a459f1d509890fcd5e75dafea7f6a2f9", "ja": "あずささんの新曲です。\nこれを、今度の仕事で歌ってもらおうかと。", "zh": "这是梓小姐的新歌。\n我想让她下次的工作唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "730a5383f22f39ee617052ac5435e1aee86403f539b98f822fb92788e11bdb1a", "ja": "まあ……！　すごく大人っぽくて、\nでも、とっても情熱的で……。これを、私が？", "zh": "哎呀……！好成熟，\n而且非常热情……这首曲子，让我来唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8331a1219b6e996da4f0a80cfed1ceb891d79eb46761eed0e5e0ab2f40a92784", "ja": "はい。実は、次回の公演ではライブハウスとの協賛で、\n特別企画をやろうと考えてまして……。", "zh": "是的。其实，我们正在考虑与Live House合作，在下次公演中策划一个特别企划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c39d2585455189f768feafee0be792a3120fb00deead5db12547a9cb886e4397", "ja": "場所はクラブミリオンで、あずささんのソロ……\nリサイタル公演をやってもらおうかと。", "zh": "地点在Club Million，我想请梓小姐办一场个人……\n独奏公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "99d19b389a92746b67d52a4fcc715ff51572ae6ecbc8ca554676d3f62313be80", "ja": "クラブミリオン？　前にこのみんとかりおっちとか、\n詩花お姉ちゃんが出た、なんかスゴイトコだよね！？", "zh": "百万俱乐部？就是之前小此美、莉绪姐，还有诗花姐姐登台的那个超厉害的地方吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "417ccd53ed274394bae7832feae49d81f63a83c5dc9496077d7d4470076d4aef", "ja": "わあ、やったね、あずささん！\nいいなあ、セクシーでカッコいいんだろうな～♪", "zh": "哇，太棒了，梓小姐！\n真好啊，肯定既性感又帅气吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "1ead57cd9667ee1ef2fcdff59b508cdd3db7fdff102a07151b1bbebc3671057e", "ja": "で、でも、そんな立派なところでリサイタルなんて……\nあの、本当に、私でいいんですか？", "zh": "可、可是，要在那么气派的地方举办独唱会什么的……那个，真的让我来没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "64b0159057bc4b2381adfa1f93d408af3665d9ca97bf2ec77e674a1631ef43a2", "ja": "いいよいいよ～、なんなら真美も出てあげる！\n見て見て、真美のアダルティへろもん！　ぽわ～ん♪", "zh": "好呀好呀～，要是可以的话真美也去出场！\n你看你看，真美的成熟费洛蒙！呼哇～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2f6e8678c82de3cbc0b1f7d3d0a5c5f83aaa529b4d736e045f8d5f8d4e7b074d", "ja": "おお、フェロモンは見えないが凄そうだな。\n前向きでいいぞ、真美！", "zh": "哦，虽然看不见信息素，但感觉很厉害啊。  \n有这股积极劲儿很好，真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1020_p", "source_sha256": "39833ea0a33fc3c3e7201807f67e7ed616eccc297c74d67c3d2551e73e554e4b", "ja": "でも、今回は、あずささんにお願いしたいんです。\nあずささんが殻を破る、いい機会だと思って。", "zh": "不过，这次我想拜托的是あずさ小姐。\n我觉得这会是让あずさ小姐突破自我的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "2b37c2526eb4b5949696b4e23e2522b580592d4029ef8fcbd652a89fb874631c", "ja": "私が、殻を……？", "zh": "我，打破……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "3d1303ec097dbdae1e7626e131419e5e1ce24775ae8ec459464886b1d32fbcf7", "ja": "やろうよ、あずささん。ゼッタイいいと思うな～。\nアタシたちも応援に行くし！　ね、真美？", "zh": "做吧，梓姐。我觉得绝对会很棒～  \n我们也会去给你加油！对吧，真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "d777e5dc4abc31e7b89d031d87dccde8b2605ef43f832b4ebba42b5728842b21", "ja": "うん、行く行くー！　宿命のライバルのステージは、\nきっちり見届けないといけないかんねっ♪", "zh": "嗯，去去去——！宿命对手的舞台，\n必须得好好见证到最后才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "f44b1a720b62dd7ecb89bed1c8071847f03e1a57c3fbd386f40224ca28707652", "ja": "わかりました。私、チャレンジしてみます。\n貴重なチャンスだと思って。", "zh": "我明白了。我会试着挑战看看的。\n这也是个难得的机会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6b91880533b82cd474e9c29ccad5d988e7e3cc1eccbebe864d46cb35dbb59e58", "ja": "おお、ありがとうございます！　そう言ってもらえると\n嬉しいです。一緒に頑張りましょう！", "zh": "哦，谢谢您！您能这么说，我很高兴。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "e28f34117f78fa8830cb03267503af5b5e0ec2e229a1a95ae4bef1537e72bec7", "ja": "やったね♪　アタシも、できることあったら、\n手伝うからさ。何でも言ってね！", "zh": "太好了♪我也是，只要有我能帮上忙的地方，就会来帮忙的。有什么事尽管告诉我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "4e841afe51f59eb9cb60cca5f1223bc3029fd2528d9e54ef3cba81b118062e3e", "ja": "真美も真美も！　たしか、ライバルに塩を送ると、\n砂糖が返ってくるんだよね？　真美めっちゃ送るね♪", "zh": "真美也要！真美也要！我记得，给对手送盐，就会收到回礼的糖，对吧？那真美要送好多好多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "5a8870e59d1cc72769754d2a974f4cc5bd24385fc6a309ff5863bc420d89743b", "ja": "ふふっ、二人ともありがとう。\nよろしくね、のり子ちゃん、真美ちゃん。", "zh": "呵呵，两位都谢谢你们。\n接下来就拜托了，纪子、真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_075_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6d8d5a7ce0618a92b1d32e4a3bf85e26880bc54b02d1e7adfeef1c7400a10890", "ja": "（あずささんの新たなチャレンジ。まずは\nいいスタートができそうだ……期待しよう！）", "zh": "（梓小姐的新挑战。看来一开始就能有个不错的开端……就期待一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
